  "Forwarding someone's intimate image without consent is abuse and an offence in Singapore at any age, and far more serious when the person is a minor. Every forward multiplies the harm. The only right move is: don't open, don't forward, report.": "在新加坡，不论年龄，未经同意转发他人的私密照片都是虐待，也是罪行；如果对方未成年，情节更加严重。每转发一次，伤害就加倍一次。唯一正确的做法是：不打开、不转发、去举报。",
  "Mei's birthday is next week. A huge surprise party? She has told me three times she hates surprises.": "小美的生日在下星期。办一场超大的惊喜派对？她跟我说过三次她讨厌惊喜。",
