  "They are people walking in a park, not a score sheet.": "她们是在公园散步的人，不是一张评分表。",
  "At a classmate's party, a girl you barely know dares you to kiss her while everyone counts down.": "在一个同学的派对上，一个你几乎不认识的女生在大家倒数时，激你亲她。",
